  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Cut brown onion into thick wedges.\n• Cut beetroot into 1cm chunks.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59ec/step-d4dbc000.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two oven trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59ec/step-9a5b5810.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine garlic & herb seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil in a medium bowl.\n• Season, then add haloumi, turning to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59ec/step-775af720.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• In the last minute, add the honey, turning haloumi to coat. Transfer to a plate to rest.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59ec/step-3f53fc30.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer roast veggies to a large bowl.\n• Add baby spinach leaves. Crumble over fetta cubes, then drizzle with the vinegar.\n• Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59ec/step-388b1b40.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie toss between plates. Top with haloumi.\n• Serve drizzled with creamy pesto dressing. Sprinkle over chilli flakes (if using). Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f8798a4264524ca97a59ec/step-6f0fb150.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
